<title>USA: Stratus Computer Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stratus Computer Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBORO, Mass. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended	Year Ended</p>
<p>			     12/29/96  12/31/95  12/29/96  12/31/95</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p> Product sales	     $124,700  $112,005 $406,956 $383,850</p>
<p> Service			 51,393    56,355  202,373  204,072</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUES	    176,093   168,360  609,329  587,922</p>
<p>  TOTAL COST OF SALES	96,975    87,871  339,558  303,190</p>
<p> Gross profit		  79,118    80,489  269,771  284,732</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p> Research and development  20,507    21,103   79,817   83,824</p>
<p> SG&amp;A			    36,761    43,431  135,197  164,340</p>
<p> Restructuring charge (a)(b)  --	  --     4,623   24,500</p>
<p>  TOTAL OPER EXPENSES	57,268    64,534  219,637  272,664</p>
<p> Operating income	    21,850    15,955   50,134   12,068</p>
<p> Other income		   1,472     1,673    6,621    9,604</p>
<p> NET INCOME		   $17,725   $14,103  $43,520  $17,338</p>
<p> WGTD AVG SHRS		 23,967    23,523   23,774   23,757</p>
<p> NET EPS			   0.74	0.60     1.83     0.73</p>
<p>		   (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year ended December 29, 1996 results include $4.6 million charge for restructuring software business.  Excluding this charge, EPS were $1.98.</p>
<p>1995 year results include $24.5 million charge for cutting workforce and consolidating facilities.  Excluding this charge, EPS were $1.55.</p>
</text>
